Puts an integer into a sorted list, before the first item that is larger. The input is the pair [x xs], where xs is sorted; the output is sorted.
---

---
(fn p
  (letrec ins (fn l
        (if (? l) [(head p) ~]
            (if (< (head p) (head l)) [(head p) l] [(head l) (ins (tail l))])))
    (ins (tail p))))
---
[3 [1 2 5 ~]] => [1 2 3 5 ~] fuel 100000
[0 ~] => [0 ~] fuel 100000
[9 [1 2 ~]] => [1 2 9 ~] fuel 100000
[2 [2 3 ~]] => [2 2 3 ~] fuel 100000
